# Third-Party Notices

This repository is a **Lite** desktop shell for Grox. It does **not** vendor the
Grok Build agent source tree.

## Runtime dependency (not bundled)

- **Grok Build CLI** — installed separately by the user (for example under
  `~/.grok/bin/grok`, on `PATH`, or via `GROK_DESKTOP_CLI`).
  Upstream: https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build
  License and third-party notices for the CLI and its crates are provided by
